  "limitations": [
    "Prototype timing is repeated same-process function cost, not actual HTTP latency or A07/A21 acceptance.",
    "Nine alternating batches retained without trimming; per-call durations are batch means, not request-tail percentiles.",
    "Crafted Pod fixtures include multibyte labels, unlike original frozen ASCII Pods.",
    "First batch includes projection construction; subsequent calls share each implementation own redacted snapshot cache.",
    "The counter is only the existing rejected-prefix sizing hint; it cannot accept any native item or replace the complete strict parser.",
